Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Ordered Topology Inventory Digest Reconciliation

Description: Canonical corrected SJS authority for one zero-effect transform that consumes exactly two complete output-only supplied ordered topology inventory digest carriers, independently rederives both through current prerequisite authority, establishes exact common profile, limits, and RootDirectory scope, and releases Equal or Different while retaining both complete lineages. It grants no temporal, physical, double-inventory, quiescence, receipt, admission, mutation, or effect authority.

