  + [M2B-SOTIDR-008] private Serialize-only output retaining both complete operands and common scope
  + [M2B-SOTIDR-009] explicit caller-order retention with no temporal meaning
  + [M2B-SOTIDR-010] closed bounded side-qualified faults and atomic failure
  + [M2B-SOTIDR-011] reserved temporal, stability, double-inventory, quiescence, receipt, and admission vocabulary
  + [M2B-SOTIDR-012] zero effects, unsafe, platform calls, dependencies, and lockfile delta
  + [M2B-SOTIDR-013] focused, static, global, evidence, audit, rollback, and provenance proof

& [VerificationContract] is independent and proportional
  + strict plan tests cover valid, malformed, overlong, unknown, missing, wrong-profile, and zero identity
  + equal root-only and mixed complete carriers release Equal
  + changed committed root or descendant field, count, and member order release Different
  + exact profile role, limit field, absent root path, RootDirectory kind, volume serial, and file identity mismatch routes are proven
  + root content difference remains Different rather than RootScope
  + correlation-only identity differences do not decide semantic disposition when complete carrier validity remains exact
  + operand swaps retain order and disposition without temporal names
  + serialization retains both complete carriers and exact common scope
  + every fault code, side relation, diagnostic bound, Display, and repeatability path is proven as constructible
  + static tests reject Deserialize, Default, public fields, public construction, bare or raw input, duplicate encoder, new hash, unsafe, platform, filesystem, clock, temporal public vocabulary, receipt, and effects
  + focused debug and overflow-checked release, workspace debug and overflow-checked release, format, warnings-denied lint, release build, warnings-denied docs, audit, recursive evidence, provenance review, rollback, clean tree, commit, and push must pass
  + physical tests and effect-bearing builders remain uninvoked

& [ImplementationBoundary] is one pure subject-local slice
  + one new module, one lib export, unit tests, one independent static test, evidence test and manifest, solution, completion review, proof, narrative, reentry, and recursive evidence updates
  + private helpers may decode plan, bound diagnostics, rederive one side, validate profiles, and extract root scope
  + public API remains three functions plus immutable data getters
  + prerequisite modules and canonical digest grammar remain unchanged

& [RollbackContract] is exact
  + remove only the future reconciliation module, export, tests, evidence, and derived closure records
  + retain base source, corrective source, fault, reprocessing manifest, corrected SJS artifacts, and proof history
  + rollback never modifies prerequisite types, profiles, digests, or physical locks

& [StopBoundary] is mandatory
  + stop on base or correction source drift, prerequisite drift, unbound correction, raw or bare input, duplicated encoder, new hash, profile coercion, limit normalization, Directory-for-root alias, cross-root disposition, Different-as-fault, bool ambiguity, temporal name, stability claim, physical grade, receipt behavior, public construction, new dependency, unsafe, platform call, filesystem, clock, effect, stale evidence, or failed proof
  + stop if any physical or effect-bearing test would be required

